OL,3,GNEWSAHit-and-run driver jailed after
OL,4,Akilling man while 'full of drink and
OL,5,Adrugs'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA driver who killed a grandfather in a
OL,8,Fhit-and-run while "full of it on drink
OL,9,Fand drugs" has been jailed for almost
OL,10,Fseven years.
OL,12,FGary Gallacher, 37, was also using his
OL,13,Fmobile phone moments before he struck
OL,14,FJames Craig in Hamilton, South
OL,15,FLanarkshire, on 27 October 2024.
OL,17,FThe 70-year-old never recovered
OL,18,Ffollowing the collision.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
