OL,3,GNEWSAHit-and-run driver jailed after
OL,4,Akilling man while 'full of drink and
OL,5,Adrugs'
OL,6,
OL,7,FGallacher, who had previous road
OL,8,Ftraffic convictions, was sentenced to
OL,9,Fsix years and nine months in jail at
OL,10,Fthe High Court in Glasgow. He had
OL,11,Fpreviously pled guilty to a charge of
OL,12,Fcausing death by dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
